# How janet-zed reads void's definition macros: each binds the symbol
# after it, as `def` does. Installed with the bundle, so an application
# gets hover and go-to-definition on `model/User` without a config of its
# own.
{:lint-as {void/db/defentity def
           void/db/entity/defentity def
           void/admin/defresource-admin def
           void/admin/resource/defresource-admin def}}
